aused Video Sources：暂停的视频源的数量"}]}]},{"ID":"20250901202801-z4aww6r","Type":"NodeListItem","ListData":{"BulletChar":42,"Marker":"Kg=="},"Properties":{"id":"20250901202801-z4aww6r","updated":"20250901203231"},"Children":[{"ID":"20250901202801-559479j","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20250901202801-559479j","updated":"20250901203231"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"Software Video Playback（软解码视频播放回调数）：平台本身不支持播放的视频的数量"}]},{"ID":"20250901203137-ulspfit","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20250901203137-ulspfit","updated":"20250901203137"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"性能瓶颈关注重点，软件解码会占用大量 CPU，移动端尤其要避免"}]}]},{"ID":"20250901202801-n13sdzs","Type":"NodeListItem","ListData":{"BulletChar":42,"Marker":"Kg=="},"Properties":{"id":"20250901202801-n13sdzs","updated":"20250901203228"},"Children":[{"ID":"20250901202801-jhb3cxh","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20250901202801-jhb3cxh","updated":"20250901203228"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"Pre-buffered frames（预缓冲帧的总数）：帧数太少可能会导致播放卡顿"}]}]},{"ID":"20250901202801-8nmqo76","Type":"NodeListItem","ListData":{"BulletChar":42,"Marker":"Kg=="},"Properties":{"id":"20250901202801-8nmqo76","updated":"20250901202801"},"Children":[{"ID":"20250901202801-stupl2v","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20250901202801-stupl2v","updated":"20250901203223"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"Pre-buffered frame limit（预缓冲帧限制）：Unity 最多可为每个剪辑缓冲 16 帧"}]},{"ID":"20250901203223-b9j60yf","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20250901203223-b9j60yf","updated":"20250901203223"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"通常固定值，无需修改"}]}]},{"ID":"20250901202801-s9ix0m1","Type":"NodeListItem","ListData":{"BulletChar":42,"Marker":"Kg=="},"Properties":{"id":"20250901202801-s9ix0m1","updated":"20250901202801"},"Children":[{"ID":"20250901202801-4c062o1","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20250901202801-4c062o1","updated":"20250901203158"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"Total frames dropped（丢帧总数）：为了保持实时性，Unity 必须跳过的帧数"}]},{"ID":"20250901203152-if58nrf","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20250901203152-if58nrf","updated":"20250901203152"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"应用程序运行缓慢且无法足够快地生成帧来实时播放时，就可能会发生这种跳帧的情况；播放卡顿判断关键指标：数量持续增长说明播放不流畅"}]}]},{"ID":"20250901202801-j5j3mpt","Type":"NodeListItem","ListData":{"BulletChar":42,"Marker":"Kg=="},"Properties":{"id":"20250901202801-j5j3mpt","updated":"20250901202801"},"Children":[{"ID":"20250901202801-m1rorqy","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20250901202801-m1rorqy","updated":"20250901203212"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"Video Clip Count：场景中视频剪辑的数量"}]}]},{"ID":"20250901202801-5zp6xnn","Type":"NodeListItem","ListData":{"BulletChar":42,"Marker":"Kg=="},"Properties":{"id":"20250901202801-5zp6xnn","updated":"20250901202801"},"Children":[{"ID":"20250901202801-1zgy5fa","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20250901202801-1zgy5fa","updated":"20250901203215"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"Total Video Memory（总视频内存）：应用程序中的视频所使用的系统内存量"}]},{"ID":"20250901203204-cc2dhed","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20250901203204-cc2dhed","updated":"20250901203204"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"如果持续增长，说明未释放视频资源或分辨率过高"}]}]}]}]}]},{"ID":"20250901202618-wnhyxv8","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20250901202618-wnhyxv8","updated":"20250901202729"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"Video 对于我们的意义"}]},{"ID":"20250901202627-2znx43v","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20250901202627-2znx43v","updated":"20250901202632"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"Video（视频）模块可以帮助我们"}]},{"ID":"20250901202636-6fojhfb","Type":"NodeList","ListData":{"Typ":1},"Properties":{"id":"20250901202636-6fojhfb","updated":"20250901202729"},"Children":[{"ID":"20250901202641-dto8ex0","Type":"NodeListItem","ListData":{"Typ":1,"Delimiter":46,"Marker":"MS4=","Num":1},"Properties":{"id":"20250901202641-dto8ex0","updated":"20250901202729"},"Children":[{"ID":"20250901202641-tzb48zc","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20250901202641-tzb48zc","updated":"20250901202641"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"排查视频卡顿的原因"}]},{"ID":"20250901202704-re25qka","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20250901202704-re25qka","updated":"20250901202729"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"关注 Total Frames Dropped（丢帧总数）、Software Video Playback（软解码视频播放回调数）\n如果 Dropped（丢弃）值持续增长说明视频播放性能不足\n如果 Software Video Playback（软解码视频播放回调数）不为 0\n证明当前视频编码格式不被硬件支持，建议改为 H.264（mp4）"}]}]},{"ID":"20250901202641-ctcom71","Type":"NodeListItem","ListData":{"Typ":1,"Delimiter":46,"Marker":"Mi4=","Num":2},"Properties":{"id":"20250901202641-ctcom71","updated":"20250901202641"},"Children":[{"ID":"20250901202641-blnmbuv","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20250901202641-blnmbuv","updated":"20250901202641"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"排查视频不播放或者无画面"}]},{"ID":"20250901202653-9azm4su","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20250901202653-9azm4su","updated":"20250901202700"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"Playing Video Sources（播放中的视频源数量） 为 0 说明视频未启动\n但 Total Video Sources（总视频源） \u003e 0，可能没调用 "},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"code","TextMarkTextContent":"Play()"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​ 或由于平台限制无法播放"}]}]},{"ID":"20250901202641-81y47z7","Type":"NodeListItem","ListData":{"Typ":1,"Delimiter":46,"Marker":"My4=","Num":3},"Properties":{"id":"20250901202641-81y47z7","updated":"20250901202641"},"Children":[{"ID":"20250901202641-vtvr16v","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20250901202641-vtvr16v","updated":"20250901202641"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"排查内存是否泄漏或者复用不当"}]},{"ID":"20250901202650-v79ufk5","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20250901202650-v79ufk5","updated":"20250901202650"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"关注 Video Clip Count（视频剪辑数量）和 Total Video Memory（总视频内存）\n视频切换多次后 Video Clip Count （视频剪辑数量）持续上升，证明没有释放销毁\n内存持续上升说明视频未释放或帧缓存堆积"}]}]},{"ID":"20250901202641-9qq09aq","Type":"NodeListItem","ListData":{"Typ":1,"Delimiter":46,"Marker":"NC4=","Num":4},"Properties":{"id":"20250901202641-9qq09aq","updated":"20250901202641"},"Children":[{"ID":"20250901202641-j5r1ae3","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20250901202641-j5r1ae3","updated":"20250901202641"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"播放有延迟或启动缓慢"}]},{"ID":"20250901202644-v0y13ix","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20250901202644-v0y13ix","updated":"20250901202646"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"关注 Pre-buffered Frames（预缓冲帧的总数），缓冲帧太少，说明视频太大 / 帧率太高 / Streaming 设置不合理"}]}]}]},{"ID":"20250901202633-i4yjypc","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20250901202633-i4yjypc","updated":"20250901202633"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"等等"}]},{"ID":"20250901202633-gb1fva1","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20250901202633-gb1fva1","updated":"20250901202633"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"总之，该模块就是保障视频流畅播放体验的利器"}]}]}